cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Weighing Matrices W(n,k) for n ≡ 0 (mod 4), n <= 100: Constructions and Exact Verification"
abstract: >-
  Computational construction and exact verification of one weighing matrix
  W(n,k) for every order n = 4, 8, ..., 100 (n ≡ 0 mod 4) and every weight
  k = 1, ..., n (1300 cases in total). The matrices are obtained from
  identity, Hadamard 2x2 blocks, direct sums, Kronecker products, Paley
  constructions, skew-Hadamard doubling and Goethals-Seidel arrays (exhaustive
  search or simulated annealing). Every stored matrix is checked exactly with
  integer arithmetic.
type: software
authors:
